esort without an adult accompanying him."],"schedule":[{"title":"All","conditions":[{"title":"Green Rain (Year 1)","rows":[["All day","In the living room"]]},{"title":"Tuesday the 9th and Tuesday the 23rd","rows":[["9:00 AM","Wakes up for the day"],["11:00 AM","Plays inside his home"],["2:00 PM","Leaves his home and heads outside to the town square"],["5:00 PM","Leaves town and walks home"],["7:00 PM","Plays inside his home"],["10:00 PM","Goes to bed for the night"]]},{"title":"Spring 11","rows":[["9:00 AM","Wakes up, concerned about having to go to the doctor. \"*sob*... I have to get my shots today.\""],["11:30 AM","Leaves home to travel to the clinic for his annual checkup. \"*gulp*... Mommy, don't make me do it.\""],["1:30 PM","Continues checkup at the clinic. \"Do I get a lollipop for being so brave?\""],["4:00 PM","Leaves the clinic to walk home, once there he plays inside"],["10:00 PM","Goes to bed for the night"]]},{"title":"Spring 17 (Bus Service Restored)","rows":[["10:20 AM","Boards the bus to Calico Desert to attend the Desert Festival"],["10:30 AM","With his mom by one of the villager shops"],["12:10 AM","Boards the bus back to the Valley"]]},{"title":"Desert Festival (As Vendor)","rows":[["11:10 AM","Boards the bus to Calico Desert"],["11:30 AM","Arrives at his booth"],["12:00 AM","Leaves booth and takes the bus back to the Valley"]]},{"title":"Winter 16","rows":[["9:00 AM","Wakes up for the day"],["11:00 AM","Plays inside his home"],["2:00 PM","Leaves his home and heads outside to the town square"],["4:30 PM","Attends the Night Market"],["11:30 PM","Goes to bed for the night"]]},{"title":"Rain","rows":[["9:00 AM","Wakes up for the day"],["11:00 AM","Plays inside his home"],["2:00 PM","Moves around inside his home"],["5:00 PM","Moves around inside his home"],["7:00 PM","Plays inside his home"],["10:00 PM","Goes to bed for the night"]]},{"title":"Summer","rows":[["9:00 AM","Wakes up for the day"],["11:00 AM","Plays inside his home"],["1:40 PM","Leaves h